        "native_id": "e9mptphquie9",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Cloudflare is investigating issues with network performance in Ashburn, US (IAD). We are working to analyse and mitigate this problem. More updates to follow shortly.",
        "created_at": "2026-10-13T04:00:44.604Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "e6s30b0mvud5",
        "status": "identified",
        "body": "The issue has been identified and a fix is being implemented.",
